  "title": "CoinVE-Edit: Instruction-Based Video Editing Model",
  "summary": "CoinVE-Edit introduces a large-scale, high-quality dataset for compositional instruction-guided video editing, enabling precise multi-region editing while preserving irrelevant content and temporal coherence. It leverages a 22B video editing model built on Wan2.1-T2V-14B and Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct, with experiments showing strong performance across multiple benchmarks.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "CoinVE-Edit introduces a 22B video editing model built on Wan2.1-T2V-14B and Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "CoinVE-Edit achieves strong performance in instruction following, compositional editing accuracy, visual quality, and temporal consistency.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "CoinVE-Edit disentangles region-aware attention for different editing instructions, enabling precise multi-region editing.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
